window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>Dealing with being a new mother and grieving the death of her mom causes Sloane to shut down on everyone around her. It seems like the more she tries to fight her current state, the worse it becomes. With her husband and the rest of her family by her side, she's determined to overcome the obstacles in front of her. Join the last Parker sister for this emotional rollercoaster.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
